Come to think of it, almost none of the girls here wear bras!

00:15:54.720 --> 00:15:57.560
You're too smart for your own good, idiot!

00:15:57.560 --> 00:16:01.100
I got a new bra yesterday.

00:16:01.100 --> 00:16:03.060
It's from France.

00:16:03.060 --> 00:16:04.690
That's nice!

00:16:04.690 --> 00:16:06.020
Hey!

00:16:06.480 --> 00:16:08.940
Mind if I try my secret move on you?

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:15.660
Hold on! Why is she qualified and I'm not?!

00:16:15.660 --> 00:16:17.370
What secret move?

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:18.620
No thanks.

00:16:19.040 --> 00:16:21.660
Please! It has to be you!

00:16:21.660 --> 00:16:23.420
No one else but you!

00:16:23.420 --> 00:16:25.880
You're the only one!

00:16:25.880 --> 00:16:28.380
Could this possibly be...

00:16:28.380 --> 00:16:32.090
What's so great about this bad-tempered panty girl?!

00:16:32.090 --> 00:16:33.340
Same goes for you!

00:16:34.890 --> 00:16:38.850
I don't want to! It's skirt flipping or some such, right?!

00:16:39.510 --> 00:16:43.390
You're worthy of my secret move because you have a br-

00:16:43.390 --> 00:16:45.850
...a certain something.

00:16:45.850 --> 00:16:49.270
I get it. It's about money, right?!

00:16:49.270 --> 00:16:51.400
That's the only thing she's got!

00:16:51.400 --> 00:16:53.860
Why do you care so much?

00:16:53.860 --> 00:16:57.620
It's a love-hate triangle!

00:16:57.620 --> 00:16:59.370
She's going wacko too!

00:16:59.370 --> 00:17:01.700
Good luck, Chiba!

00:17:01.700 --> 00:17:04.290
Don't get involved! You'll make it worse.

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:06.670
I'll help you out too!

00:17:06.670 --> 00:17:07.830
Help?!

00:17:08.290 --> 00:17:11.210
Don't tell me she's also wearing a bra...

00:17:11.210 --> 00:17:13.590
Can I try it on you?

00:17:13.590 --> 00:17:14.380
Huh?

00:17:14.380 --> 00:17:16.720
Hey! I thought I was the only one!

00:17:17.140 --> 00:17:20.930
Yoshioka! I didn't know you'd steal your friend's man!

00:17:20.930 --> 00:17:23.180
That's not what I meant!

00:17:23.180 --> 00:17:26.230
Forget that, lick my foot right now!

00:17:26.230 --> 00:17:27.440
I'm outta here.

00:17:28.860 --> 00:17:33.070
My inaugural bra unhooking... Who should I pick?

00:17:33.070 --> 00:17:34.240
Oh yeah!

00:17:34.240 --> 00:17:36.740
I've got two hands!

00:17:36.740 --> 00:17:39.490
Huh? Chiba?

00:17:39.490 --> 00:17:41.620
I wonder where he went.

00:17:42.410 --> 00:17:45.750
Light-Speed Bra Unhooker!

00:17:46.120 --> 00:17:47.250
What's that?

00:17:47.920 --> 00:17:49.210
Dang it!

00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:53.800
We have swimming class next!

00:17:55.760 --> 00:18:00.100
I knew you were gonna flip our skirts, you pervo porcine gorilla!

00:18:05.730 --> 00:18:08.980
It would've been the same even if it'd worked.

00:18:13.150 --> 00:18:15.990
I was pretty popular back then.

00:18:16.530 --> 00:18:18.990
You can't turn back the clock.

00:18:18.990 --> 00:18:20.990
I like how you look now, Papa!

00:18:20.990 --> 00:18:25.040
You girls used to fight for my attention back then.

00:18:25.040 --> 00:18:26.410
Papa, I love you!

00:18:26.410 --> 00:18:28.710
Me too!

00:18:28.710 --> 00:18:31.130
Don't go romanticizing it on your own!

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:32.960
It's the truth though.

00:18:33.880 --> 00:18:37.050
I'll kiss you enough for all three of us!

00:18:37.050 --> 00:18:38.430
Ouch!

00:18:38.430 --> 00:18:40.260
Don't suck on my beard!

00:18:41.800 --> 00:18:43.220
Don't eat it, either.

00:18:43.220 --> 00:18:46.220
Oh yeah! I've got some guests coming over today!

00:18:46.220 --> 00:18:49.640
You're an eyesore, so just stay quiet in this room!

00:18:49.640 --> 00:18:51.650
Guests? Your friends?

00:18:52.310 --> 00:18:55.230
T-They aren't my friends!

00:18:59.820 --> 00:19:01.570
Sorry for intruding!

00:19:01.570 --> 00:19:02.740
Hi!

00:19:03.330 --> 00:19:07.290
Let's get this presentation plan over with and go home!

00:19:07.290 --> 00:19:08.960
Where's Futaba and your dad?

00:19:08.960 --> 00:19:09.870
They're out.

00:19:09.870 --> 00:19:12.880
I wanted to meet your dad...

00:19:12.880 --> 00:19:14.670
There's no need for that!

00:19:14.670 --> 00:19:15.710
Eh?

00:19:15.710 --> 00:19:18.380
I'm <i>nothing</i> like him!

00:19:18.380 --> 00:19:21.550
He's fat, loud and totally annoying!

00:19:21.930 --> 00:19:25.680
That's <i>exactly</i> like you, from head to toe!

00:19:26.930 --> 00:19:28.180
Shut up! Shut up!

00:19:28.180 --> 00:19:29.520
Stop it!

00:19:29.520 --> 00:19:32.150
P-Please, stop fighting!

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:34.560
Come on, finish this and get out of here!

00:19:34.560 --> 00:19:36.360
You're part of this too!

00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:39.280
I'm just here to supervise you!

00:19:39.280 --> 00:19:41.780
Mitsuba! Who's this cool looking guy?!

00:19:42.200 --> 00:19:43.410
Wow!

00:19:43.410 --> 00:19:45.370
Is he a model or an actor?

00:19:45.370 --> 00:19:47.290
Just what relationship do you have with him?!

00:19:47.790 --> 00:19:50.370
Uh... It's, umm...

00:19:50.370 --> 00:19:53.790
It's a very close relationship!

00:19:55.290 --> 00:19:59.460
Y-You mean... you're going out with him?

00:19:59.460 --> 00:20:03.050
We're linked by an unbreakable bond!

00:20:03.050 --> 00:20:04.970
That's wonderful!

00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:07.810
Well, technically, it's not a lie.

00:20:07.810 --> 00:20:10.850
And his name? What's his name?!

00:20:10.850 --> 00:20:12.850
S-Soujirou.

00:20:12.850 --> 00:20:14.650
That sounds so cool!

00:20:14.650 --> 00:20:18.360
H-Have you... ever kissed him?

00:20:21.070 --> 00:20:22.700
O-Of course!

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:25.120
You're lying!

00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:26.700
I'm not!

00:20:26.700 --> 00:20:30.500
Then show me some proof! Try calling him!

00:20:31.000 --> 00:20:33.750
I-I can't! He's a busy guy!

00:20:34.170 --> 00:20:37.090
Oh yeah? So it <i>is</i> a lie.

00:20:37.090 --> 00:20:38.380
Fine!

00:20:44.340 --> 00:20:45.970
It's from the other room.

00:20:48.260 --> 00:20:49.220
Yes?

00:20:49.220 --> 00:20:51.520
How are you?

00:20:52.060 --> 00:20:53.060
Is that you, Mitsuba?

00:20:53.060 --> 00:20:55.230
He called her by her name!

00:20:55.600 --> 00:20:58.020
Tell him "I love you!"

00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:01.230
What's up with her?

00:21:01.650 --> 00:21:04.820
Come on, tell him, quick!

00:21:04.820 --> 00:21:07.240
If you can't do it, you must be lying.

00:21:07.240 --> 00:21:08.990
I, uh...

00:21:15.870 --> 00:21:18.540
S-Soujirou...

00:21:19.420 --> 00:21:21.050
I LOVE YOU!!

00:21:23.420 --> 00:21:25.050
Satisfied?!

00:21:25.050 --> 00:21:27.140
No! It can't be...

00:21:27.140 --> 00:21:29.760
I love him more!

00:21:30.390 --> 00:21:31.310
Idiot!

00:21:31.310 --> 00:21:34.020
What?! Futaba's part of this, too?!

00:21:34.020 --> 00:21:38.730
We take a bath together every night, and sometimes I even sleep with him!

00:21:38.730 --> 00:21:43.030
Bathing together?! Sleeping together?!

00:21:43.030 --> 00:21:47.320
I love him more than the both of you!

00:21:47.320 --> 00:21:49.280
Even Hitoha's part of this?!

00:21:50.830 --> 00:21:53.410
I love all three of you!

00:21:53.410 --> 00:21:54.040
Papa!

00:21:54.500 --> 00:21:57.790
Who would've thought you three would still fight over me?

00:21:58.370 --> 00:22:01.800
Come! I'll hug you all you want!

00:22:04.300 --> 00:22:06.720
I don't really care about you.

00:22:16.020 --> 00:22:18.190
I love him the most!

00:22:18.190 --> 00:22:22.190
Me! Me! <i>Me!</i>

00:22:22.190 --> 00:22:24.480
What happened to our presentation?

00:22:38.490 --> 00:22:43.830
The three-minute rule says this candy's still safe to eat!

00:22:44.250 --> 00:22:50.800
Really, aren't you tired of making a fuss about this every time?

00:22:49.760 --> 00:22:50.800
Yeah!

00:22:50.800 --> 00:22:56.260
Just stop showing me that pretense of kindness

00:22:56.260 --> 00:22:59.520
Will it do good in the long term? You ask

00:22:59.520 --> 00:23:01.850
It's none of your business!

00:23:01.980 --> 00:23:05.310
Inspection time for all~

00:23:05.310 --> 00:23:07.820
Haven't seen that before? Does it even exist?

00:23:08.400 --> 00:23:09.150
Let's check it out!

00:23:08.730 --> 00:23:12.280
Everyone's perfectly uniform!

00:23:11.400 --> 00:23:12.280
Yeah! Yeah!

00:23:12.280 --> 00:23:17.330
That's why we're straying from the path... Hurry!

00:23:14.410 --> 00:23:15.320
Go! Go!

00:23:17.330 --> 00:23:21.580
It's a good day for new encounters

00:23:21.580 --> 00:23:29.750
Next week's sparkling if you feel the weak pulse!

00:23:29.750 --> 00:23:36.800
Let's have a good sleep!

00:23:36.800 --> 00:23:42.060
Once you're fully rested and recharged

00:23:42.640 --> 00:23:45.980
Let's go backpacking!

00:23:55.880 --> 00:23:59.750
Yabe was so heroic putting his life on the line to protect Mitsuba and Hitoha,

00:23:59.750 --> 00:24:02.670
but Mitsuba and Sugi are involved in a love triangle with Chiba!

00:24:02.670 --> 00:24:05.670
However, Mitsuba's in love with someone else,

00:24:04.790 --> 00:24:10.080
Beautiful Drama

00:24:05.670 --> 00:24:07.890
and Futaba loves them as well!

00:24:07.890 --> 00:24:09.680
Is that how you saw it?
